{"ordinal":15402,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452102889472","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_DontShoot_058edc1","source":"Alkonost: Что дальше? Гости исчезнут, или мы теперь всегда будем с ними делить наши города?","target":"Alkonost: Și apoi? Musafirii vor dispărea sau va trebui să împărțim mereu orașele cu ei?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15403,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695178","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_DontShoot_01758b2","source":"Alkonost: Если честно, я и сама жутко напугана.","target":"Alkonost: Sincer, și eu sunt îngrozită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15404,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695177","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_DontShoot_0078f3c","source":"Alkonost: Но это всё продолжается, а конца как будто и не предвидится в ближайшее время.","target":"Alkonost: Dar toate astea continuă și parcă nu se întrevede un sfârșit prea curând.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15405,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695176","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_DontShoot_021e134","source":"Alkonost: Я так хочу, чтобы можно было уже выдохнуть и не быть в постоянном страхе.","target":"Alkonost: Mi-aș dori atât de mult să putem răsufla ușurați și să nu trăim mereu cu frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15406,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695175","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_DontShoot_0fa5bc5","source":"Alkonost: Знаешь, меня всё заебло.","target":"Alkonost: Știi, m-am săturat de tot căcatul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15407,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695174","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_DontShoot_095fd42","source":"Alkonost: Что будет, если ты так и останешься обособленным от остальных?","target":"Alkonost: Ce se va întâmpla dacă rămâi în continuare rupt de ceilalți?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15408,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695173","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_DontShoot_01d5707","source":"Alkonost: Но если поддаваться панике, будешь ли ты отличаться от Гостей?","target":"Alkonost: Dar dacă te lași cuprins de panică, te vei mai deosebi de Musafiri?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15409,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695172","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_DontShoot_0436f3c","source":"Alkonost: Я всё понимаю. Ты оказался в очень непростой ситуации.","target":"Alkonost: Înțeleg totul. Te afli într-o situație foarte grea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15410,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695171","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_DontShoot_09956b3","source":"Alkonost: Сестра не выдержала, сдалась.","target":"Alkonost: Sora mea n-a mai rezistat și a cedat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15411,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695170","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_DontShoot_08bd2d9","source":"Alkonost: Жизнь всегда проверяла нас на крепость. Всегда было очень тяжело.","target":"Alkonost: Viața ne-a încercat mereu puterile. A fost întotdeauna foarte greu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15412,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695169","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Death_0281ff1","source":"Alkonost: Горечью.","target":"Alkonost: Cu amărăciune.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15413,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452098695168","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Death_03170c1","source":"Alkonost: Вот чем закончилась песнь жизни.","target":"Alkonost: Așa s-a încheiat cântarea vieții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15414,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500875","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_Gun_0724a97","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15415,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500874","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_Gun_0e17f5d","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15416,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500873","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_Gun_0f0527c","source":"Alkonost: Подумай ещё, не делай глупостей.","target":"Alkonost: Mai gândește-te, nu face prostii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15417,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500872","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_Gun_0b3ad9f","source":"Alkonost: Подожди, разве по новостям говорили, что ТАКИЕ подмышки – признак Гостя?","target":"Alkonost: Stai, au spus la știri că axilele ASTEA sunt un semn de Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15418,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500871","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_0a8c55e","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15419,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500870","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_046fb3f","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15420,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500869","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_0573c23","source":"Alkonost: Жаль, что тебе тоже надо.","target":"Alkonost: Păcat că și tu trebuie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15421,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500868","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_0153098","source":"Alkonost: Лучше успокойся и не принимай эмоциональных решений. Я часто так сестре говорю.","target":"Alkonost: Mai bine liniștește-te și nu lua hotărâri la nervi. Îi spun des asta surorii mele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15422,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500867","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_0af2b3e","source":"Alkonost: Думаешь, ты выглядишь по-другому?","target":"Alkonost: Crezi că tu arăți altfel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15423,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500866","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_0b743fa","source":"Alkonost: Какой смысл? Тебе взгляд показался слишком пустым?","target":"Alkonost: Ce rost are? Ți s-a părut privirea prea goală?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15424,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500865","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_Gun_04cfd75","source":"Alkonost: Какой смысл? Тебе взгляд показался слишком быстрым или пустым?","target":"Alkonost: Ce rost are? Ți s-a părut privirea prea iute sau prea goală?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15425,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452094500864","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_Gun_0111b1d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15426,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306570","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_Gun_07073ed","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15427,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306569","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_Gun_056985f","source":"Alkonost: Думаешь, можешь тыкать ружьём в лицо кому угодно?","target":"Alkonost: Crezi că poți îndrepta pușca spre fața oricui?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15428,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306568","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_Gun_0daad02","source":"Alkonost: Думаешь, тебе одному тяжело?","target":"Alkonost: Crezi că doar ție îți este greu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15429,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306567","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_Gun_0958922","source":"Alkonost: Я недавно начала курить. Из-за таких, как ты.","target":"Alkonost: M-am apucat de curând de fumat. Din cauza unora ca tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15430,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306566","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_Gun_0516ba0","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15431,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306565","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_Gun_0b9b5c3","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15432,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306564","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_Gun_00b923d","source":"Alkonost: Нам и так досталось с сестрой в жизни. Оставь ты это ружьё.","target":"Alkonost: Eu și sora mea am trecut deja prin destule în viață. Lasă pușca jos.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15433,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306563","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_0f065cf","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15434,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306562","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_08c7eca","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15435,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306561","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_056cc2b","source":"Alkonost: Да и в целом не до этого.","target":"Alkonost: Și, oricum, acum nu am timp de asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15436,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452090306560","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_018db98","source":"Alkonost: Вообще я за собой слежу, но сейчас не взяла с собой бритву.","target":"Alkonost: De obicei am grijă de mine, dar acum nu mi-am luat aparatul de ras.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15437,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112265","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_0d78c26","source":"Alkonost: Даже в такое сумасшедшее время.","target":"Alkonost: Chiar și în vremurile astea nebunești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15438,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112264","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_0d44789","source":"Alkonost: Вообще я брею, стараюсь ухаживать за собой.","target":"Alkonost: De obicei mă rad, încerc să am grijă de mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15439,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112263","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Armpit_0d4f1cb","source":"Alkonost: Я покажу. Но, прошу, не приставай к сестре, хорошо? Она и так слишком устала.","target":"Alkonost: Îți arăt. Dar, te rog, nu o necăji pe sora mea, bine? E deja prea obosită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15440,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112262","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_06a81ef","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15441,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112261","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_03c6564","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15442,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112260","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_039dedc","source":"Alkonost: Может, уже отплакала своё.","target":"Alkonost: Poate că și-a plâns toate lacrimile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15443,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112259","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_0a454eb","source":"Alkonost: Да, сестра часто плачет, но глаза у нас до сих пор очень похожи. Не красные, я имею в виду.","target":"Alkonost: Da, sora mea plânge des, dar ochii noștri seamănă încă foarte mult. Nu sunt roșii, vreau să spun.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15444,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112258","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_02cc81b","source":"Alkonost: И меня это тревожит.","target":"Alkonost: Și asta mă îngrijorează.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15445,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112257","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Eyes_0f5c738","source":"Alkonost: Да, сестра часто плачет, но глаза у нас до сих пор очень похожи. Только взгляд у неё спокойнее.","target":"Alkonost: Da, sora mea plânge des, dar ochii noștri seamănă încă foarte mult. Numai privirea ei e mai liniștită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15446,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452086112256","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_077406b","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15447,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917963","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_0c7b5eb","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15448,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917962","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_01cfc49","source":"Alkonost: А как ещё должны выглядеть руки человека, на котором ответственность за две жизни сразу?","target":"Alkonost: Cum altfel ar trebui să arate mâinile cuiva care răspunde de două vieți?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15449,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917961","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Hands_0a11ac7","source":"Alkonost: Моя сестра не в состоянии сейчас о себе заботиться. Поэтому я – единственная, кто что-то делает руками.","target":"Alkonost: Sora mea nu poate avea grijă de ea acum. Așa că eu sunt singura care mai face ceva cu mâinile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15450,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917960","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_0914cc6","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15451,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917959","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_08383a5","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15452,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452081917958","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alkonost_Teeth_0cab8f8","source":"Alkonost: Закончилось неудачно. Но научило за зубами ухаживать.","target":"Alkonost: N-a ieșit bine. Dar m-a învățat să am grijă de dinți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-388.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
